  "rules": [
    "Preserve source IDs, order codes, snapshots, hashes, references and UTC timestamps; do not regenerate them during transfer.",
    "New ticket timestamps use DATETIME(6). Existing runtime tables must be checked separately for precision and ID length before importing.",
    "Copy physical files separately as MEDIA_DIR/.tickets/{id}.bin; bytes and SHA-256 must match metadata.",
    "Retain revoked_at, deleted_at, revoke_reason, file_kind, partner_shared and sharing_version even when their workflows are not exposed in PHP yet.",
    "Do not import staging tables directly into runtime tables without validation, dry-run and support for all related modules."
  ],
